It’s cozy season and these Southern Westchester restaurants deliver the vibes. Whether you are dining with your kids or on a date night these restaurants will not disappoint. In the craziness of the holiday season, take a night off of cooking and enjoy a cozy dining experience. 

@zeroottonove Italian in Tuckahoe with a cozy fireplace in the back room will transport you to southern Italy.

@cantinalobos in Pelham for family friendly creative Mexican cuisine. Enjoy a margarita and the best duck taco in Westchester. 

@encorelarchmont in Larchmont for cozy authentic French bistro.

@underhillscrossing In Bronxville for a Manhattan vibe in downtown Bronxville. 

@goosefeatherny in Tarrytown, Modern Chinese located in a historic 19th century mansion. 

Which one are you trying?
Be sure to follow @bischofkristin for all things Westchester.
- Kristin Bischof
#kristinbischof #jbfsir #mbrteam

